<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5884" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būthrōtum</span></b> , i,
			n. (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būthrōtŏs</span></b> , i,
			f., <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 13, 721</span></i>), = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βουθρωτόν</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βουθρωτός</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town on the coast of Epirus</i>, now <i>Butrinto</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				3, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 3, 293 sq.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 3,
				10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 1, 1, §
			4</span></i>.—Hence, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būthrōtĭus</span></b> , a,
			um, adj., <i>of Buthrotum</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ager, causa,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 16, 16</span></i>
			, A, 4: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Plancus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 15, 29, 3</span></i>
			; and <i>subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būthrōtĭi</span></b> ,
				ōrum, m., <i>the inhabitants of Buthrotum</i>, <i><span class="en">id.
				ib. 14, 11, 2</span></i>; 15, 2, 2; 16, 16, A, 4.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
